@baseUrl = http://127.0.0.1:8088/api
@buyerToken = replace-with-buyer-token
@productId = 1
@addressId = 1

### 二手直接购买（初始订单必须待付款）
POST {{baseUrl}}/secondhand/{{productId}}/buy
Authorization: Bearer {{buyerToken}}
Content-Type: application/json

{
  "addressId": {{addressId}},
  "remark": "UC17 direct purchase"
}

### 重复购买必须失败
POST {{baseUrl}}/secondhand/{{productId}}/buy
Authorization: Bearer {{buyerToken}}
Content-Type: application/json

{
  "addressId": {{addressId}}
}
